# title: Fixed-strike lookback call
# category: Asians, lookbacks and ladders
# underlyings: 1
# source: Goldman, Sosin & Gatto, Path Dependent Options: Buy at the Low, Sell at the High, Journal of Finance, 1979
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on the highest weekly close of the year rather than the final one.
# param: strike = 1.0 | percent | Strike, % of the initial level

2027-01-04
    strike = 1.0
    s0 = spot()
    hi = spot()

schedule(2027-01-11, 2027-12-27, 1W, US, F)
    hi = max(hi, spot())

2028-01-04
    hi = max(hi, spot())
    pays max(hi - strike * s0, 0)
